  "name": "2022-2023-school-authorities-audited-financial-statements-combined-financial-statements",
  "notes": "These combined financial statements provide provincial roll-ups compiled from information reported within the individual audited financial statements and schedules for each public, separate, francophone and charter school authority in the province for the 2022-2023 school year.\r\n\r\nThe combined financial statements of the 2022-2023 school jurisdictions’ audited financial statements do not include reporting for Valhalla Charter School as the financial statements are not yet finalized.\r\n",
